"005:001 This is the genealogy of men in the day in which God made Adam; in the image of God he made him:",
"005:002 male and female he made them, and blessed them; and he called his name Adam, in the day in which he made them.",
"005:003 And Adam lived two hundred and thirty years, and begot a son after his own form, and after his own image, and he called his name Seth.",
"005:004 And the days of Adam, which he lived after his begetting Seth, were seven hundred years; and he begot sons and daughters.",
"005:005 And all the days of Adam which he lived were nine hundred and thirty years, and he died.",
"005:006 Now Seth lived two hundred and five years, and begot Enos.",
"005:007 And Seth lived after his begetting Enos, seven hundred and seven years, and he begot sons and daughters.",
"005:008 And all the days of Seth were nine hundred and twelve years, and he died.",
"005:009 And Enos lived one hundred and ninety years, and begot Cainan.",
"005:010 And Enos lived after his begetting Cainan, seven hundred and fifteen years, and he begot sons and daughters.",
"005:011 And all the days of Enos were nine hundred and five years, and he died.",
"005:012 And Cainan lived one hundred and seventy years, and he begot Maleleel.",
"005:013 And Cainan lived after his begetting Maleleel, seven hundred and forty years, and he begot sons and daughters.",
"005:014 And all the days of Cainan were nine hundred and ten years, and he died.",
"005:015 And Maleleel lived one hundred and sixty and five years, and he begot Jared.",
"005:016 And Maleleel lived after his begetting Jared, seven hundred and thirty years, and he begot sons and daughters.",
"005:017 And all the days of Maleleel were eight hundred and ninety and five years, and he died.",
"005:018 And Jared lived one hundred and sixty and two years, and begot Enoch:",
"005:019 and Jared lived after his begetting Enoch, eight hundred years, and he begot sons and daughters.",
"005:020 And all the days of Jared were nine hundred and sixty and two years, and he died.",
"005:021 And Enoch lived one hundred and sixty and five years, and became the father of Mathusala.",
"005:022 And Enoch was well-pleasing to God after his begetting Mathusala, two hundred years, and he begot sons and daughters.",
"005:023 And all the days of Enoch were three hundred and sixty and five years.",
"005:024 And Enoch was well-pleasing to God, and was not found, because God translated him.",
"005:025 And Mathusala lived one hundred and sixty and seven years, and begot Lamech.",
"005:026 And Mathusala lived after his begetting Lamech eight hundred and two years, and begot sons and daughters.",
"005:027 And all the days of Mathusala which he lived, were nine hundred and sixty and nine years, and he died.",
"005:028 And Lamech lived one hundred and eighty and eight years, and begot a son.",
"005:029 And he called his name Noe, saying, This one will cause us to cease from our works, and from the toils of our hands, and from the earth, which the Lord God has cursed.",
"005:030 And Lamech lived after his begetting Noe, five hundred and sixty and five years, and begot sons and daughters.",
"005:031 And all the days of Lamech were seven hundred and fifty-three years, and he died.",
"005:032 6:1a And Noe was five hundred years old, and he begot three sons, Sem, Cham, and Japheth."
