"036:001 And these are the generations of Esau; this is Edom.",
"036:002 And Esau took to himself wives of the daughters of the Chananites; Ada, the daughter of Aelom the Chettite; and Olibema, daughter of Ana the son of Sebegon, the Evite;",
"036:003 and Basemath, daughter of Ismael, sister of Nabaioth.",
"036:004 And Ada bore to him Eliphas; and Basemath bore Raguel.",
"036:005 And Olibema bore Jeus, and Jeglom, and Core; these are the sons of Esau, which were born to him in the land of Chanaan.",
"036:006 And Esau took his wives, and his sons, and his daughters, and all the persons of his house, and all his possessions, and all his cattle, and all that he had got, and all things whatever he had acquired in the land of Chanaan; and Esau went forth from the land of Chanaan, from the face of his brother Jacob.",
"036:007 For their substance was too great for them to dwell together; and the land of their sojourning could not bear them, because of the abundance of their possessions.",
"036:008 And Esau lived in mount Seir; Esau, he is Edom.",
"036:009 And these are the generations of Esau, the father of Edom in the mount Seir.",
"036:010 And these are the names of the sons of Esau. Eliphas, the son of Ada, the wife of Esau; and Raguel, the son of Basemath, wife of Esau.",
"036:011 And the sons of Eliphas were Thaeman, Omar, Sophar, Gothom, and Kenez.",
"036:012 And Thamna was a concubine of Eliphaz, the son of Esau; and she bore Amalec to Eliphas. These are the sons of Ada, the wife of Esau.",
"036:013 And these are the sons of Raguel; Nachoth, Zare, Some, and Moze. These were the sons of Basemath, wife of Esau.",
"036:014 And these are the sons of Olibema, the daughter of Ana, the son of Sebegon, the wife of Esau; and she bore to Esau, Jeus, and Jeglom, and Core.",
"036:015 These are the chiefs of the son of Esau, even the sons of Eliphas, the firstborn of Esau; chief Thaeman, chief Omar, chief Sophar, chief Kenez,",
"036:016 chief Core, chief Gothom, chief Amalec. These are the chiefs of Eliphas, in the land of Edom; these are the sons of Ada.",
"036:017 And these are the sons of Raguel, the son of Esau; chief Nachoth, chief Zare, chief Some, chief Moze. These are the chiefs of Raguel, in the land of Edom; these are the sons of Basemath, wife of Esau.",
"036:018 And these are the sons of Olibema, wife of Esau; chief Jeus, chief Jeglom, chief Core. These are the chiefs of Olibema, daughter of Ana, wife of Esau.",
"036:019 These are the sons of Esau, and these are the chiefs; these are the sons of Edom.",
"036:020 And these are the sons of Seir, the Chorrhite, who inhabited the land; Lotan, Sobal, Sebegon, Ana,",
"036:021 and Deson, and Asar, and Rison. These are the chiefs of the Chorrhite, the son of Seir, in the land of Edom.",
"036:022 And the sons of Lotan were Chorrhi and Haeman; and the sister of Lotan, Thamna.",
"036:023 And these are the sons of Sobal; Golam, and Manachath, and Gaebel, and Sophar, and Omar.",
"036:024 And these are the sons of Sebegon; Aie, and Ana; this is the Ana who found Jamin in the wilderness, when he tended the beasts of his father Sebegon.",
"036:025 And these are the sons of Ana; Deson—and Olibema was daughter of Ana.",
"036:026 And these are the sons of Deson; Amada, and Asban, and Ithran, and Charrhan.",
"036:027 And these are the sons of Asar; Balaam, and Zucam, and Jucam.",
"036:028 And these are the sons of Rison; Hos, and Aran.",
"036:029 And these are the chiefs of Chorri; chief Lotan, chief Sobal, chief Sebegon, chief Ana,",
"036:030 chief Deson, chief Asar, chief Rison. These are the chiefs of Chorri, in their principalities in the land of Edom.",
"036:031 these are the kings which reigned in Edom, before a king reigned in Israel.",
"036:032 And Balac, son of Beor, reigned in Edom; and the name of his city was Dennaba.",
"036:033 And Balac died; and Jobab, son of Zara, from Bosorrha reigned in his stead.",
"036:034 And Jobab died; and Asom, from the land of the Thaemanites, reigned in his stead.",
"036:035 And Asom died; and Adad son of Barad, who cut off Madiam in the plain of Moab, ruled in his stead; and the name of his city was Getthaim.",
"036:036 And Adad died; and Samada of Massecca reigned in his stead.",
"036:037 Samada died; and Saul of Rhooboth by the river reigned in his stead.",
"036:038 And Saul died; and Ballenon the son of Achobor reigned in his stead.",
"036:039 And Ballenon the son of Achobor died; and Arad the son of Barad reigned in his stead; and the name of his city was Phogor; and the name of his wife was Metebeel, daughter of Matraith, son of Maizoob.",
"036:040 These are the names of the chiefs of Esau, in their tribes, according to their place, in their countries, and in their nations; chief Thamna, chief Gola, chief Jether,",
"036:041 chief Olibema, chief Helas, chief Phinon,",
"036:042 chief Kenez, chief Thaeman, chief Mazar,",
"036:043 chief Magediel, chief Zaphoin. These are the chiefs of Edom in their dwelling-places in the land of their possession; this is Esau, the father of Edom."
